WEBVTT

00:13:29.621 --> 00:13:34.704
the male and the female who who do have
different ways of doing things.

00:13:34.704 --> 00:13:35.704
We need both.

00:13:36.412 --> 00:13:39.162
Yeah, I think so too. And you know,

00:13:39.579 --> 00:13:43.621
some of the research on Queen Bees has
suggested that that's much more of

00:13:43.621 --> 00:13:46.079
a response to inequality than
a cause of inequality.

00:13:46.954 --> 00:13:50.871
So that, you know, it's not that that
women leaders necessarily want to operate

00:13:50.871 --> 00:13:54.954
this way, but they feel like they
have to do it in order to get

00:13:54.954 --> 00:13:56.371
and then maintain their position.

00:13:57.496 --> 00:14:00.496
I wondered if there's a there is a
parallel in chimp society there